#: cli/main.cpp
msgctxt "an unnamed volume of the workbox's own in workbox info"
msgid "%1 (its own)"
msgstr "%1 (propio)"

#: cli/main.cpp
msgctxt "a volume in workbox info"
msgid "%1 (read-only)"
msgstr "%1 (solo lectura)"

#: cli/main.cpp
msgctxt "a volume of the workbox's own in workbox info"
msgid "%1 → %2 (volume)"
msgstr "%1 → %2 (volumen)"

#: cli/main.cpp
msgid ""
"A volume, as Podman's -v: folder:target shares a folder of your home at "
"target, a folder of the workbox's home (absolute or ~/…); name:target gives "
"the workbox a volume of its own with that name, and target alone an unnamed "
"one, removed with it. Options: ro or rw. Can be given more than once. Not "
"your whole home, nor a folder with keys or what the host runs at login; in "
"~/.config and ~/.local, only read-only."
msgstr ""
"Un volumen, como el -v de Podman: carpeta:destino comparte una carpeta de tu "
"carpeta personal en destino, una carpeta de la carpeta personal del workbox "
"(absoluta o ~/…); nombre:destino le da al workbox un volumen propio con ese "
"nombre, y destino solo, uno sin nombre; se eliminan con él. Opciones: ro o "
"rw. Se puede indicar más de una vez. No tu carpeta personal entera, ni una "
"carpeta con claves o con lo que el sistema ejecuta al iniciar sesión; en "
"~/.config y ~/.local, solo de lectura."

#: cli/main.cpp
msgid ""
"As the workbox's root, in /root: root only inside it, the user outside it."
msgstr ""
"Como el root del workbox, en /root: root solo dentro de él; fuera, el "
"usuario."

#: cli/main.cpp
msgctxt "field of workbox info"
msgid "Color"
msgstr "Color"

#: cli/main.cpp
msgid "Created the workbox %1 (\"%2\")."
msgstr "Se ha creado el workbox %1 («%2»)."

#: cli/main.cpp
msgid ""
"Creates a workbox: a container that shares nothing with the host but the "
"folders given with -v.\n"
"\n"
"Example:\n"
"  workbox create c1 --name \"Client 01\" --color '#3584e4' -v ~/Clients/01:~/"
"project"
msgstr ""
"Crea un workbox: un contenedor que no comparte nada con el sistema salvo las "
"carpetas indicadas con -v.\n"
"\n"
"Ejemplo:\n"
"  workbox create c1 --name \"Cliente 01\" --color '#3584e4' -v ~/Clientes/"
"01:~/proyecto"

#: cli/main.cpp
msgid "Don't ask before removing it."
msgstr "No preguntar antes de eliminarlo."

#: cli/main.cpp
msgid "Every running workbox."
msgstr "Todos los workboxes en marcha."

#: cli/main.cpp
msgid "Every workbox."
msgstr "Todos los workboxes."

#: cli/main.cpp
msgctxt "field of workbox info"
msgid "Home"
msgstr "Carpeta personal"

#: cli/main.cpp
msgctxt "column of workbox list"
msgid "ID"
msgstr "ID"

#: cli/main.cpp
msgctxt "field of workbox info"
msgid "ID"
msgstr "ID"

#: cli/main.cpp
msgctxt "field of workbox info"
msgid "Image"
msgstr "Imagen"

#: cli/main.cpp
msgid ""
"Its color: #rgb, #rrggbb or r,g,b, each 0-255 (default: the palette's color "
"that looks the most different from the other workboxes')."
msgstr ""
"Su color: #rgb, #rrggbb o r,g,b, cada uno de 0 a 255 (por defecto, el color "
"de la paleta que más se distingue de los de los otros workboxes)."

#: cli/main.cpp
msgid ""
"Let the user use sudo in it, without a password: whatever runs in it can "
"then be its root."
msgstr ""
"Permite al usuario usar sudo dentro, sin contraseña: así, cualquier cosa que "
"se ejecute en él puede ser su root."

#: cli/main.cpp
msgid ""
"Lists the workboxes.\n"
"\n"
"Example:\n"
"  workbox list"
msgstr ""
"Lista los workboxes.\n"
"\n"
"Ejemplo:\n"
"  workbox list"

#: cli/main.cpp
msgctxt "column of workbox list"
msgid "NAME"
msgstr "NOMBRE"

#: cli/main.cpp
msgctxt "field of workbox info"
msgid "Name"
msgstr "Nombre"

#: cli/main.cpp
msgid "No workbox is running."
msgstr "No hay ningún workbox en marcha."

#: cli/main.cpp
msgid "No workboxes yet: workbox create <id> creates one."
msgstr "Aún no hay workboxes: workbox create <id> crea uno."

#: cli/main.cpp
msgid "Nothing removed."
msgstr "No se ha eliminado nada."

#: cli/main.cpp
msgid "Only their ids, one per line."
msgstr "Solo sus ids, uno por línea."

#: cli/main.cpp
msgid ""
"Opens a shell in a workbox, starting it first if it's stopped. In a "
"terminal, the background takes the workbox's hue, and the prompt shows its "
"name.\n"
"\n"
"Example:\n"
"  workbox enter c1"
msgstr ""
"Abre un shell en un workbox, y antes lo arranca si está parado. En una "
"terminal, el fondo toma la tonalidad del workbox y el prompt muestra su "
"nombre.\n"
"\n"
"Ejemplo:\n"
"  workbox enter c1"

#: cli/main.cpp
msgid ""
"Remove the workbox %2? Everything in it and in its volumes will be lost. [y/"
"N] "
msgid_plural ""
"Remove the %1 workboxes (%2)? Everything in them and in their volumes will "
"be lost. [y/N] "
msgstr[0] "¿Eliminar el workbox %2? Se perderá todo lo que hay en él y en sus volúmenes. [s/N] "
msgstr[1] "¿Eliminar los %1 workboxes (%2)? Se perderá todo lo que hay en ellos y en sus volúmenes. [s/N] "

#: cli/main.cpp
msgid "Removed the workbox %1."
msgstr "Se ha eliminado el workbox %1."

#: cli/main.cpp
msgid ""
"Removes a workbox and its home, stopping it first if it runs: everything in "
"them is lost. Asks for its id first, or with --all, for a yes, unless --"
"yes.\n"
"\n"
"Example:\n"
"  workbox rm c1"
msgstr "Elimina un workbox y su carpeta personal, y antes lo detiene si está en marcha: se pierde todo lo que contienen. Antes pide su id o, con --all, un sí, salvo con --yes.\n\nEjemplo:\n  workbox rm c1"

#: cli/main.cpp
msgid ""
"Removing the workbox %1 (\"%2\") loses everything in it and in its home.\n"
"Type its id to remove it: "
msgstr ""
"Al eliminar el workbox %1 («%2») se pierde todo lo que hay en él y en su "
"carpeta personal.\n"
"Escribe su id para eliminarlo: "

#: cli/main.cpp
msgctxt "column of workbox list"
msgid "STATUS"
msgstr "ESTADO"

#: cli/main.cpp
msgid ""
"Shows a workbox: its name, color, status, image and settings.\n"
"\n"
"Example:\n"
"  workbox info c1"
msgstr ""
"Muestra un workbox: su nombre, color, estado, imagen y ajustes.\n"
"\n"
"Ejemplo:\n"
"  workbox info c1"

#: cli/main.cpp
msgid "Started the workbox %1."
msgstr "Se ha arrancado el workbox %1."

#: cli/main.cpp
msgid ""
"Starts a workbox.\n"
"\n"
"Example:\n"
"  workbox start c1"
msgstr ""
"Arranca un workbox.\n"
"\n"
"Ejemplo:\n"
"  workbox start c1"

#: cli/main.cpp
msgctxt "field of workbox info"
msgid "Status"
msgstr "Estado"

#: cli/main.cpp
msgid "Stopped the workbox %1."
msgstr "Se ha detenido el workbox %1."

#: cli/main.cpp
msgid ""
"Stops a workbox, or with --all every running one, and everything running in "
"them.\n"
"\n"
"Example:\n"
"  workbox stop c1"
msgstr "Detiene un workbox, o con --all todos los que están en marcha, y todo lo que se ejecuta en ellos.\n\nEjemplo:\n  workbox stop c1"

#: cli/main.cpp
msgctxt "field of workbox info"
msgid "Sudo"
msgstr "Sudo"

#: cli/main.cpp
msgid "The name it's shown with (default: its id)."
msgstr "El nombre con el que se muestra (por defecto, su id)."

#: cli/main.cpp
msgid "The workbox %1 is already running."
msgstr "El workbox %1 ya está en marcha."

#: cli/main.cpp
msgid "The workbox %1 is already stopped."
msgstr "El workbox %1 ya está parado."

#: cli/main.cpp
msgid "The workbox's id."
msgstr "El id del workbox."

#: cli/main.cpp
msgid "There are no workboxes to remove."
msgstr "No hay workboxes que eliminar."

#: cli/main.cpp
msgid ""
"Usage: workbox <command> [options]\n"
"\n"
"Runs containers, each a separate place to work, that share nothing with the "
"host.\n"
"\n"
"Commands:\n"
"  create  Create a workbox\n"
"  list    List the workboxes\n"
"  info    Show a workbox\n"
"  start   Start a workbox\n"
"  stop    Stop a workbox\n"
"  enter   Open a shell in a workbox\n"
"  rm      Remove a workbox and its home\n"
"\n"
"\"workbox <command> --help\" shows a command's options; \"workbox --"
"version\", its version."
msgstr ""
"Uso: workbox <comando> [opciones]\n"
"\n"
"Ejecuta contenedores, cada uno un lugar de trabajo aparte, que no comparten "
"nada con el sistema.\n"
"\n"
"Comandos:\n"
"  create  Crea un workbox\n"
"  list    Lista los workboxes\n"
"  info    Muestra un workbox\n"
"  start   Arranca un workbox\n"
"  stop    Detiene un workbox\n"
"  enter   Abre un shell en un workbox\n"
"  rm      Elimina un workbox y su carpeta personal\n"
"\n"
"«workbox <comando> --help» muestra las opciones de un comando; «workbox --"
"version», su versión."

